 | `MCPEXP002` | Subclassing `McpServer`/`McpClient` | `#pragma warning disable MCPEXP002` |

 Suppress project-wide: `<NoWarn>MCPEXP001;MCPEXP002</NoWarn>` in `.csproj`.

